# GitHub CLI via mise

- Invoke `gh` using `mise x -- gh ...` (or `mise x gh@latest -- gh ...` if the unpinned tool must be fetched). Do not run bare `gh` or activate it in project mise configuration just for an invocation.
- Use this wrapper for every GitHub CLI command, including issue, pull request, workflow, and project operations.
- Example: `mise x -- gh pr view 19 --repo TimerErTim/logandaim.at`.
